| **Purpose** | Overlay shells: Bootstrap `.modal`/`.offcanvas`, KS `#diagramModal`, `#topicPreviewModal`, custom `[role="dialog"]`; Tab-cycle probe when openers exist |
| **Passing** | Dismiss controls (`data-bs-dismiss`, `.btn-close`, `.diagram-modal-close`, `[data-topic-preview-close]`), paired openers, focus stays in shell, `aria-modal="true"`, `hidden` when closed |
