| **After** | `docNavOffcanvas` + `btn btn-forge` opener + `btn-close`/`data-bs-dismiss`; canonical diagram modal fragment from `diagram_modal_fragment.py` |
| **Evidence** | `appFocusTrapReport` metrics and remediation steps |
